!*** Unimolecular decomposition of ethyl hydrogen carbonate (EHC): ccoc*ooh ***
!------------------------------------------------------------------------------
!CCOC*OOH =) C2H5OH + CO2 3.67E+12 0.00 4.63E+04  !Ea, A from Rate expression DEC (Manion et al JPC A 101 5494-5499)
